$\Kempirical = 2$ requires 1v2 CI lower bound $> \theta{=}0.60$ and 2v3 CI lower bound $\leq \theta$ (Eq.~\ref{eq:kstar}).
Extended results (all models) in Table~\ref{tab:kstar_ci_extended}.}
\label{tab:kstar_ci}
